      "values": {
        "text": {
          "Text": "Render 3D's Shading on Toon: the light falls in a few flat Bands instead of smoothly, and an Outline is drawn round every silhouette. Try Bands from 2 to 8 and the Outline width in its Look section; set Shading to Normals or Depth to see what the render knows, or Reflections to One under Quality for mirror-like surfaces."
